<title>USA: Nutramax to buy 47 pct outstanding shares.</title>
<headline>Nutramax to buy 47 pct outstanding shares.</headline>
<dateline>GLOUCESTER, Mass 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nutramax Products Inc said Monday it had reached an agreement with medical equipment rental business MEDIQ to buy from it 4,037,000 shares representing 47 percent of Nutramax at $9 each.</p>
</text>
